---
import TraversyLabLinks from '../../components/TraversyLabLinks.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Traversy Lab - private automation system"
  description="Information about Traversy Lab and its read-only use of Google account data."
  pageTitle="traversy-lab.md"
  currentSection="legal"
>
  <TraversyLabLinks />

  <section class="section">
    <h1 class="h1"><span class="hash"># </span>Traversy Lab</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Traversy Lab is Brad Traversy's private personal automation system. It is
      not a public product and does not accept public signups.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="h2"><span class="hash">## </span>what it does</h2>
    <p>
      Traversy Lab connects to Google accounts that Brad owns and explicitly
      authorizes. It uses that access for a small set of personal workflows:
    </p>
    <ul class="prose-list">
      <li>copying upcoming Google Calendar events into a private planning note</li>
      <li>including relevant calendar and email items in a private morning briefing</li>
      <li>reviewing sponsorship inquiries and recording qualified leads in a private tracker</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Google access is read-only. Traversy Lab cannot send or modify email, and
      it cannot create, change, or delete calendar events.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="h2"><span class="hash">## </span>data and control</h2>
    <p>
      The system reads only the Google data needed for these workflows. It does
      not sell Google user data or use it for advertising. The authorized
      account owner can revoke access at any time from their Google Account.
    </p>
    <p>
      Read the <a href="/traversy-lab/privacy" class="link">privacy policy</a>{' '}
      for the full data-handling details and the{' '}
      <a href="/traversy-lab/terms" class="link">terms of use</a> for the conditions
      that apply to this private system.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="h2"><span class="hash">## </span>contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about Traversy Lab or its Google access can be sent to{' '}
      <a href="mailto:travxlabs@gmail.com" class="link">travxlabs@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="comment">
    // private system, public disclosure<span class="cursor"></span>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose-list {
    margin: 12px 0 16px;
    padding-left: 20px;
    list-style: disc;
    color: var(--fg-1);
  }

  .prose-list li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
</style>
